    <statement><p>Find the gradient <m>\nabla f</m> of the function <m>f</m>
given the differential.
<me>df = \left(4x^{3}+1\right)ye^{x}dx+x^{4}e^{x}dy</me></p>
<p><m>\nabla f =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(4x^{3}+1\right)ye^{x}\boldsymbol{i}+x^{4}e^{x}\boldsymbol{j}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>df = f_x\,dx + f_y\,dy</m> and
<m>\nabla f = f_x \mathbf{i} + f_y \mathbf{j}</m>,
we have
<me>\nabla f = \left(4x^{3}+1\right)ye^{x}\boldsymbol{i}+x^{4}e^{x}\boldsymbol{j}.</me>



</solution>
